<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">22062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>One thousand Palestinians have now been killed under Israel's own declared ceasefire, Gaza's health ministry reports — among them two hundred sixty-five children.</s> <s>Finance Minister Smotrich has promised what he calls economic strangulation, as the West Bank's economy shrank by four billion dollars.</s> <s>Former Israeli prime ministers and generals have accused their own government of crossing a line it can't walk back.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran walked away from peace talks in Switzerland within hours of their opening, after Donald Trump threatened fresh strikes unless Tehran reined in Hezbollah.</s> <s>An Islamabad memorandum signed on Wednesday had set a sixty-day roadmap and mandated a ceasefire in Lebanon.</s> <s>Foreign Minister Araghchi says his delegation won't return until frozen assets and oil waivers come back, while Parliament's speaker signals military readiness.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's Congress party has rebuked one of its own, the senior member Shashi Tharoor, for defending Prime Minister Modi.</s> <s>Tharoor met the lieutenant governor of contested Kashmir, then praised Modi's remarks to American officials about protecting Indian sailors.</s> <s>His drift toward the governing party's line exposes a widening fault inside an opposition already struggling to hold together.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Colombians vote Sunday in a runoff that could decide whether new oil exploration is banned outright.</s> <s>Gustavo Petro's chosen heir, Cepeda, backs the moratorium, while the outsider De La Espriella, who led the first round, vows to reverse it.</s> <s>Washington has endorsed De La Espriella, and the result may land within hours of the polls closing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Egypt has charged the very woman who reported abuse inside an Alexandria hospital.</s> <s>After Omnia Sweidan's testimony went viral, the hospital's legal office filed against her, and prosecutors dismissed her account as inexperience rather than investigating what she described.</s> <s>She faces criminal court on the twenty-seventh of June, while the conduct she reported goes unexamined.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's cotton heartland in Punjab has missed its planting target by more than half a million acres.</s> <s>Less cotton means less cottonseed, forcing the country to import more edible oil and draining hard-currency reserves it can barely spare.</s> <s>For a textile economy already under foreign-exchange strain, the bill lands on the factory floor and the household grocery basket.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Australian police have unearthed two point seven tonnes of cocaine buried in plastic tubs beneath false floors — the largest haul in the nation's history.</s> <s>Officers traced the eight hundred sixteen million dollar cache from a Queensland beach to a vessel detained in the Solomon Islands.</s> <s>Burial works as cold storage for a Pacific trade so vast that even a record seizure barely moves the street price.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An explosion struck Qatar's Barzan gas facility at Ras Laffan on Sunday, the heart of the country's liquefied natural gas operations.</s> <s>Those plants supply much of Europe and Asia, and QatarEnergy says the fire was contained with no leak.</s> <s>Officials have offered no cause and no casualty count, leaving the continents that depend on that gas watching nervously.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Johannesburg spent just one percent of its budget on infrastructure maintenance, against a global standard of eight.</s> <s>South Africa's parliament heard the city lost eight and a half billion rand to utility leaks while carrying billions more in irregular spending under investigation.</s> <s>Audit failures keep climbing even as officials insist the situation's improving.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russian drones struck a Ukrainian army fuel depot near Dnipro, setting off a heavy fire.</s> <s>Moscow's defence ministry says its Geran-2 drones hit a site supplying military vehicles, part of a sustained campaign against the fuel that keeps the front moving.</s> <s>That account rests on a single Russian statement, and Kyiv hasn't confirmed it.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Giant viruses, long invisible to science, turn out to be major regulators of life in the polar seas.</s> <s>They steer the flow of matter through microbial communities that drive the planet's biogeochemical cycles, acting as unseen ecosystem engineers.</s> <s>Their full diversity and their role in carbon cycling remain unmapped, a gap that widens as the poles warm fastest.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Japan shifted six millimetres eastward when a shear wave from the two thousand eleven Tohoku earthquake bounced off the Earth's core.</s> <s>Researchers at the University of Chicago found the returning wave triggered a plate-boundary slip spanning three thousand kilometres, thirteen minutes after the rupture.</s> <s>These core-reflected waves were never before recognised as a force that can move tectonic plates.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A fluorinated molecule has revived fosfomycin, an ageing antibiotic, against bacteria that had learned to resist it.</s> <s>The compound hijacks a glucose channel in the bacterial wall, smuggling the drug inside and boosting its potency one hundred twenty-eight-fold in resistant <sub alias="E coli">E. coli</sub>.</s> <s>Because fosfomycin's off-patent, reviving it costs far less than inventing a new drug from scratch.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>General Motors posted four and a quarter billion dollars in quarterly profit the same three months it cut a thousand workers from its Detroit Factory Zero.</s> <s>Fifty collaborative robots now attach body panels along the line once worked by human hands.</s> <s>The United Auto Workers local condemned the move, and the company hasn't said where the robots go next.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In China, a vision system called GinkgoSense-Net can now spot fruit on the branch with ninety-five percent accuracy through shadow and clutter.</s> <s>Lab-trained models usually fail the moment leaves and glare get in the way, so the breakthrough here is robustness in a real field, not a clean benchmark.</s> <s>Reliable detection like this is the last bottleneck before harvest robots can work an orchard on their own.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>